Command "update" is deprecated, use 'azd deploy' from 'azure.ai.evaluations' instead
The legacy agent evaluation workflow has been removed. This command only provides migration guidance.

Install the evaluations extension with 'azd extension install azure.ai.evaluations', then use 'azd deploy'. Legacy evaluation configuration and arguments are not automatically converted.

Invocations fail without authentication, service requests, or changes to project or environment files. No arguments are forwarded to the new commands.

Usage
  azd ai agent eval update [flags]

Global Flags
  -C, --cwd string         : Sets the current working directory
      --debug              : Enables debug and diagnostics logging
  -e, --environment string : The name of the environment to use
  -h, --help               : help for update
      --no-prompt          : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
  -o, --output string      : The output format (default "default")

Examples
    azd extension install azure.ai.evaluations
    azd deploy
